{"product_id":"iqos-terea-oasis-pearl","title":"IQOS Terea Oasis Pearl","description":"\u003cp\u003eTerea Oasis Pearl combines a mild tobacco blend with a subtle, exotic fruity note and a hint of menthol. The result is a smooth, balanced taste experience with a hint of holiday – ideal for those who like it pleasantly fresh and not too intense.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThese SMARTCORE STICKS™ have been specially developed for IQOS ILUMA devices and contain an integrated metal heating element. This ensures even heat distribution without combustion – for a clear taste and less odour. \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 pack contains 20 sticks.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 carton contains 200 sticks.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"IQOS","offers":[{"title":"PACK","offer_id":42010892140599,"sku":"Terea Oasis Pearl - Pack","price":860.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"CARTON","offer_id":42010892173367,"sku":"Terea Oasis Pearl - Carton","price":7250.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/terea-oasis-pearl-pack.webp?v=1764777105","url":"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/iqos-terea-oasis-pearl","provider":"[YOUR BRAND]","version":"1.0","type":"link"}




